('33', 'IFcSg4YvuVlx56msjbdf', 'j7jU2tjlmFKP6xJ5C7uh', 'TxBLyNP4uiV4qThNKuBH', 'steel versus aluminium comparison', 'material comparison (steel vs aluminium)', 'message', 'I noticed a marked difference in steel versus aluminium. I haven''t had time to look at it properly, but I will be doing so later this evening and will come back to you.', '2026-06-18 13:05:50+00', 'lost', '2026-09-18 06:41:52.850622+00', 'misha'),
