('50', 'IFcSg4YvuVlx56msjbdf', 'K0INBScjVtzko6Ehhh2N', 'dvZ8rVciGKlTBYQYoW2M', 'matches what we had in mind', 'design/style approval signal', 'message', 'It is the below image that matches what we had in mind. However, we are thinking of just for the bottom pane (on either side), not the bottom two panes.', '2026-08-19 07:51:51+00', 'won', '2026-09-18 06:42:49.08811+00', 'misha');


