Nice to meet you Alan and Chris.

So to breakdown what we need before survey which will include you Hannah.

Hannah - RAL colour and Handle choice colour confirmed (info in other email chain)

Alan & Chris - In order for the survey to take place next Tuesday we will need the pre-survey form completed, this will include confirmation that the FFL and metre datum has been marked out to insure we can take accurate measurements. We will also need photos of these marked out and of the full opening to confirm it is ready to measure.

