('381', 'IFcSg4YvuVlx56msjbdf', 'Sjonyw15YT9v11dqiPUy', '3672', NULL, 'Hi Ruth,

Thank you for your time this evening, and for the drink, it was great to meet you.

As discussed, the two damaged panels form part of the existing six panel bifold door system. Unfortunately, it would not be possible to replace these panels individually, and a complete replacement of the six panel bifold door set would therefore be required.

Please find attached your revised quotation, which now reflects a more accurate opening size.

The quotation includes a full site survey, detailed CAD drawings for approval, professional installation, removal and disposal of the existing doors, and all applicable product warranties.

Having reworked the quotation based on the correct configuration, dimensions, and tinted glass specification, the cost was initially coming in above the budget discussed. However, we are keen to work with you on this project and have been able to secure a special discount beyond our usual maximum allowances to bring the proposal in line with the £10,000 budget mentioned.

I have agreed this internally with my Director, taking into account the marketing opportunity and potential to establish a relationship with yourselves for future business.

If possible, it would be helpful if you could check whether the hotel has any records relating to the original door order, particularly the RAL colour specification. If we can obtain this information, we will be able ensure a colour match to the existing doors.

Regarding the handles that are causing issues, I would be happy to forward the contact details of a specialist repair service based in London who may be able to assist, we can discuss this separately.

Should you wish to proceed, I will arrange for the deposit invoice and sales agreement to be issued for signature. Once received, our Detailing team will prepare the CAD drawings for Status B approval and a surveyor will be allocated to carry out a full manufacturing survey. Following sign-off, the doors will then be released into production.

If you have any questions in the meantime, please feel free to give me a call.', 'NbnxcGAnNYeGPG3YTxCk', '2026-06-11 19:27:38+00', 'f', NULL, NULL, 'General', '2026-09-25 10:47:45.635281+00', 'misha_full_run'),
