('444', 'kHcvavc8fEeqkEPTK2T8', 'oqg9IA2ycXmqtjkdhvUu', NULL, '204', 'Hi Peter,
Thanks for your email, and for being open about where your budget needs to be.

I''ve spoken with my director and we''ve reviewed the project internally. Although we''re unable to get all the way down to the £20,000 budget without changing the specification, we are keen to work with you and have therefore agreed to offer a 5% discount on the project.

This brings the total contract value, including VAT, to £23,927.

I genuinely believe this represents excellent value for the quality of the products and installation you''ll be receiving, and we''ve quoted everything exactly in line with the agreed design and specification.

If you''re happy to proceed, we can raise the deposit invoice straight away on Monday and start getting everything moving forward our end.

I look forward to hearing from you and hopefully getting everything moving on Monday.

￼', 'nlT13JmSSz0N0GXp7QSX', '2026-07-10 13:09:32+00', 't', 'Deposit & Sales Contract', '5.8199277430555556', 'Homeowner', '2026-09-25 10:48:06.002185+00', 'misha_full_run'),
