('570', 'kHcvavc8fEeqkEPTK2T8', 'Joqk7gnWJI4rYZGV4WS0', NULL, '389', 'Hi Pippa,
Thanks for your email.
In terms of colours, we can offer any four-digit RAL colour, so there is a wide range of whites available to choose from.
As Crittall is manufactured from galvanised steel and then powder coated, the finish is different to how traditional timber doors are painted. Wooden doors are generally painted on site with a brush, whereas the Crittall finish is a factory-applied powder coat, giving a more consistent and durable finish.
It depends on what paint has been used for the current doors if it is a 4 digit ral paint then we can match it exactly, if not then we will have to match it as closely as possible.', 'iKC3XAOAPGW2bRTANytB', '2026-08-19 08:35:32+00', 't', 'Quote Sent', '0.18293940972222222222', 'Homeowner', '2026-09-25 10:48:51.796773+00', 'misha_full_run'),
