('581', 'IFcSg4YvuVlx56msjbdf', 'WtSW7eYj4AlwWAZFwDPG', NULL, '413', 'Hi Alex & Shaun,

Thank you again for confirming your order, we look forward to assisting you further with your project.

I have just sent over your deposit invoice & sales contract, please let me know if you have not received these.

If you could please fill in & complete the sales contract where requested, this should then automatically return to myself. Once these are received, the project file will be created and our Detailing team will begin preparing the full technical drawings. Please allow up to 2 weeks (7-10 working days) for the initial drawings to be issued.

Could you also let me know your preferred window handle option? I have attached the brochure below, we can then add this to the drawings.

The frame colours currently allowed for are as follows:

Pool House - Interpon D1036, SW268JR, Finish: Scuro Matt

Aquatic Gallery/ Garage - RAL 7032 Matt

As discussed, the current cost for the Aquatic Gallery / Garage items includes a single colour RAL finish. Should you wish to proceed with a dual colour finish (RAL 7032 Matt externally and White internally), a surcharge would apply.
The standard uplift for a dual colour finish is typically 12%. However, as a gesture of goodwill, we have reviewed this and reduced the additional cost where possible. The total uplift for the dual colour finish on these items would be £1,267.00.

Please let me know if you would like to proceed with this option, and I can get this updated next week.

If you have any questions in the meantime, please do not hesitate to contact me.', 'iaFsMcFwNPe4prUqT06B', '2026-06-19 12:14:35+00', 'f', NULL, NULL, 'Contractor', '2026-09-25 10:48:55.239634+00', 'misha_full_run'),
