('600', 'kHcvavc8fEeqkEPTK2T8', '0VR1kgRgPMyRUZ7eb7Vz', NULL, '448', 'Hi Huw & Wendy,

Thanks for your email and for sending across the photos and dimensions.

I have attached your quotation to this email for your review.

The quote is for genuine Crittall doors that are hand crafted in steel.

In terms of fixing the doors, we will require something solid to fix into most of our clients choose wood for this. In terms of internal doors we always recommend to completing all your internal finishes and we will come in once all this has been completed and fit the doors. We can of course come and survey before then as long as the finish floor level is in place which it look like it is with your tiles in place, we would also need to know what the wall make up is to be.

The doors can be powder coated in any 4 digit ral colour so we can offer 7006.

Manufacture lead times for Crittall is 12-14 weeks from time of our detailed drawings being signed off.

If it is just the one door or both doors the install should take 1 day but may take an extra day so allow for this just in case.

Please do let me know if you would like a call as it may be easier to discuss the process over the phone.

I look forward to hearing from you.

￼', 'rYnpRThLzwwTGEmsm3P3', '2026-08-04 12:34:13+00', 'f', NULL, NULL, 'Homeowner', '2026-09-25 10:49:01.132226+00', 'misha_full_run'),
