('912', 'IFcSg4YvuVlx56msjbdf', 'gD0KA8W15ldgOOOQYa61', NULL, '897', 'Good evening Robin,

Thank you again for your enquiry, apologies for the delay in coming back to you here, it has been a particularly busy week.

I have just sent your quotation through from our system, which should now be in your inbox. Please let me know if you have not received it.

The prices provided include detailed CAD drawings for approval, supply and delivery.

As discussed, I have allowed for our Heritage aluminium ’Steel look’ range. I have allowed for the arched head windows and toplights where required, this is a development our factory released earlier this year to be able to offer full height arched head windows and doors in the Heritage aluminium system, that not many companies are able to offer.

For your reference, I have attached a copy of the Heritage brochures. You may also find it useful to browse some of our recently completed projects on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/bespokeglazingdesign

I have also included a specification sheet with further information and graphics of the items. I have made a comment against the items which allow for arched heads, we are unable to show this on the software. For items such as Type A, B and H this also shows the itemised items that will be coupled together to make up the combination frames as required.

Happy to pick up a call Monday to talk through this in further detail.

If you would like to discuss any aspect of the quotation, explore alternative options, or make any adjustments to the specification, please do not hesitate to get in touch.

I look forward to hearing your thoughts.', 'UddVBQOmPOnrmd302w9C', '2026-06-19 20:44:37+00', 'f', NULL, NULL, 'Contractor', '2026-09-25 10:50:41.260392+00', 'misha_full_run'),
