('990', 'IFcSg4YvuVlx56msjbdf', '1gQweCIPTN2onGgMah8f', NULL, '1012', 'This would be something the builder would need to do, it''s outside of our fitters remit. The making good and decorating/plastering would be done by others. It wouldn''t be a big job though! It won''t prevent us getting going on the doors and doing the survey to get things into manufacture then can organise for someone to come out and do it close to the installation date. Worth asking a neighbour to see if they know someone locally who would take a look at it. We have a few contractors but they only tend to do bigger jobs and don''t want you to be charged more than it''s worth! Sent from another device (+447428553036 )', 'O2CgZXbgW33Qk5zPrnyp', '2026-08-28 07:59:05.344+00', 'f', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-25 10:51:06.505251+00', 'misha_full_run'),
