('997', 'kHcvavc8fEeqkEPTK2T8', 'TnsuyGcKlyv7yaYCquIb', NULL, '1027', 'Hi Ian,
Thanks for the update, I appreciate it.
That makes perfect sense, and it’s good to hear the project is still very much on.
Just so you have the information when making the decision, Crittall typically implement their annual price increase in January, and historically this has been around 5%. Obviously I can’t confirm what the increase will be for next year until Crittall announce it, but I wanted to make you aware as it may be worth taking into consideration when deciding on the timing of the expenditure.
