('1195', 'IFcSg4YvuVlx56msjbdf', 'PITqLNU0T4u529yNaHuq', NULL, '1313', 'Good evening Raminder,

Thank you again for your enquiry and sending the information through.

I have just sent your quotation through from our system, which should now be in your inbox. Please let me know if you have not received it.

The prices provided include a full site survey, detailed CAD drawings for approval, professional installation, and all applicable warranties.

Both of the sketches you have provided will be achievable and will not vary in cost, as this is simply a choice whether you want the full triangular shape or 150mm step at the bottom.

For your reference, I have attached a copy of our general brochure. You may also find it useful to browse some of our recently completed projects on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/veritasglazingsolutions

If you did want to proceed and were to place an order by Wednesday next week, we could get the Status B drawings over to you for approval the following week. These drawings confirm the specification and technical details (excluding final dimensions) and will enable us to place the profile order. The earlier we can place the profile order, the greater control we have over the overall programme and lead times.

This approach also gives us time to review and finalise dimensions without causing delay. Whether we undertake a site survey or work from agreed construction sizes. Once dimensions are agreed, we will issue the Status A drawings for approval. Following sign off, these will be released to the factory in line with the fabrication schedule.

If you have any questions regarding the quotation or the next steps, please feel free to give me a call.

I look forward to hearing your thoughts.', 'HaKwQArE9gGT2yHQCQrg', '2026-06-12 16:36:16+00', 'f', NULL, NULL, 'Homeowner', '2026-09-25 10:52:10.33165+00', 'misha_full_run'),
