('1279', 'kHcvavc8fEeqkEPTK2T8', 'TnsuyGcKlyv7yaYCquIb', NULL, '1435', 'Hey  Ian

Ive Drawing the below to show the issue.

With the over all Width on 3000mm if I Divide the Width by 8 with all the Panes the same Width you end up with a Smaller door at 1500m.

