('1317', 'kHcvavc8fEeqkEPTK2T8', 'LHeX4sxDktYtsxK5mC98', NULL, '514', 'Hi Peadar,

Thank you for your time yesterday. It was great to talk through the project with you.

Please find the quotation attached for your project.

All of the external glazing has been quoted in the Crittall Homelight PAS 24 TE system, while the internal glazing has been quoted in the Crittall Innervision system.

The Homelight PAS 24 TE system is a relatively new addition to the Crittall range and has undergone significant development to achieve a U-value of 1.3 while also meeting approved document part Q of the Building Regulations. It is effectively a combination of the Crittall W20 TE system and the standard Homelight PAS 24 system.

I''ve attached brochures for both the Homelight PAS 24 and W20 TE systems. As the Homelight PAS 24 TE system is so new, Crittall has not yet produced a dedicated brochure for it.

The external profiles remain the same as the standard Homelight PAS 24 system, but the frame incorporates additional internal milling to create an air break, significantly improving the system''s thermal performance.

As discussed, I will also speak with our Janisol partners to obtain a quotation for the Janisol Arte 2.0 system. This is likely to take around a week, but I wanted to ensure you had the pricing for the genuine Crittall solution before Friday.

Please let me know your thoughts once you''ve had a chance to review everything. If you have any questions or would like to discuss any aspect of the quotation, I''d be more than happy to help.

Quote

